\begin{theorem} \label{thm:criticality}
        Assume that $f$ satisfies \ref{assum:A2}. There is an open neighborhood $U \subseteq \R^n$ of $x^*$ such that if \ref{behav:B1} holds for an initial point $x^0 \in U$, then the limit $\bar{x}$ of $(x^k)_k$ is a critical point of $f$.
