            = -\lim_{l \rightarrow \infty} \nabla f_i(x^{k_l})^\top H_{k_l} \nabla f_i(x^{k_l}) \\
            &= -\nabla f_i(\bar{x})^\top \bar{H} \nabla f_i(\bar{x}).
